      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ONE LAST BEER (4) charged out of the boxes with a strong early sectional but swamped late when a close up fourth (19.15) at Q Straight over 350m. Goes very well from this draw with four wins and two minor placings from seven starts. Has ability and is a key runner. FROM A DISTANCE (1) has a strong record this track and trip with seven wins and six placings from 20 starts. Was out of the placings last time (16.60) at Q Straight in a Grade 3/4, finishing fourth and beaten 4.5 lengths. Suited here and expected to run well. UNSTABLE MABLE (3) has a strong record here with six wins and six placings from 16 starts. Placed last time (19.80) at this track in a Free For All, finishing second and beaten 4 lengths. With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. NOAKI RADAR (2) has a solid strike rate at this distance.",
